{"id": "102924", "title": "制氧方舱采购项目需求公示(2026-JW27-W1008)", "sourceUrl": "https://www.plap.mil.cn/freecms/site/juncai/ggxx/info/2026/8a1d02849e9211d9019f12b4f08d444a.html", "date": "2026-07-02", "source": "军队采购网", "content": "我单位拟对制氧方舱采购项目参数进行公示，广大供应商可以对需求参数和商务资质要求的完整性、合理性、公正性提出具体意见建议，防止出现指向性、排他性等问题。请广大供应商予以支持。 一、项目名称：制氧方舱采购项目 二、026 年 7 月 7 日 五、 其他说明： （ 1）如对技术参数及资质要求有任何合理意见、建议，可在公示期内将意见建议表（附件3）填写完毕后，加盖单位公章，反馈至我单位。 （ 2）技术参数、资质要求等相关需求最终以本项目采购公告和采购文件为准。 本采购项目参数公示相关信息在 “ 军队采购网 ” （ www.plap.cn ）上发布。\n采购方式: 1 | \n\n<a href=\"https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d02849e9211d9019f12b4f08d444a/00105E/42717C4EE7C7401D9B302F99B51D637A\">附件1.pdf.pdf</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d02849e9211d9019f12b4f08d444a/00105E/D3ADE6CEE0EA4238905AD55FF395037D\">附件2.pdf.pdf</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d02849e9211d9019f12b4f08d444a/00105E/2AE28F3399DB4869AD65834B675185F4\">附件3.pdf.pdf</a>\n\n42717C4EE7C7401D9B302F99B51D637A\nD3ADE6CEE0EA4238905AD55FF395037D\n2AE28F3399DB4869AD65834B675185F4", "html": "", "method": "采购意向", "region": "西藏自治区", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d02849e9211d9019f12b4f08d444a/00105E/42717C4EE7C7401D9B302F99B51D637A", "name": "42717C4EE7C7401D9B302F99B51D637A", "ext": "download"}, {"url": "https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d02849e9211d9019f12b4f08d444a/00105E/D3ADE6CEE0EA4238905AD55FF395037D", "name": "D3ADE6CEE0EA4238905AD55FF395037D", "ext": "download"}, {"url": "https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d02849e9211d9019f12b4f08d444a/00105E/2AE28F3399DB4869AD65834B675185F4", "name": "2AE28F3399DB4869AD65834B675185F4", "ext": "download"}], "hasAttachment": true, "is_bidding": true}